xfce4-docklike-plugin (0.4.2-0caramos1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Docklike Taskbar 0.4.2 for CaramOS Xfce on Ubuntu 24.04: the middle
    island of the CaramOS taskbar, pinned and running apps.
  * Packaging from Debian's 0.4.3-1 by Kirill Rekhov, without
    libxfce4windowing: 0.4.3 needs libxfce4windowing 4.19.4 and noble has
    4.19.3, while 0.4.2 uses libwnck like the rest of Xfce 4.18.

